Usage of code:
  -add-dir value
    	extra directory agents may read, outside the worktree (repeatable)
  -agent string
    	coding agent: claude, codex or agy (default "claude")
  -base string
    	branch or commit each cell branch starts from (default "main")
  -call-budget float
    	USD cap per cell (enforced by claude; codex and agy report cost as unknown) (default 1)
  -continue-from string
    	start each cell from irrigator/<RUNID[:8]>/<cell> when that branch exists
  -depends value
    	ID=DEP[,DEP]: run ID after DEP and show it DEP's summary
  -model string
    	agent model (default: sonnet for claude, the agent's own default otherwise)
  -name string
    	plan name
  -out string
    	also write the plan to this file
  -plan-only
    	print the plan and do not run it
  -repo string
    	git repository the agents change (default ".")
  -run string
    	new run directory (default: runs/code-<time>)
  -task value
    	one coding cell as ID=PROMPT; repeat for more
  -timeout string
    	time limit per cell (default "30m")
  -verify value
    	ID=COMMAND run in ID's worktree after the agent finishes; non-zero fails the cell
  -workers int
    	cells that run at once (default 2)
  -worktrees string
    	worktree root (default: irrigator-worktrees beside the repo)
error: flag: help requested
